n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Azuth\" title=\"Azuth\">Azuth</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"currency\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Currency</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skie_(currency)\" title=\"Skie (currency)\">Skie</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p8_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p8-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7,500<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basel_Indoulur\" title=\"Basel Indoulur\">Basel Indoulur</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Halagard\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Halagard\">Inhabitants of  Halagard</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Locations in Halagard (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0hhbGFnYXJkP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Locations in  Halagard</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Halagard (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9IYWxhZ2FyZD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Organizations in  Halagard</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Halagard</b> was a city located in central <a href=\"/wiki/Halruaa\" title=\"Halruaa\">Halruaa</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TFRA-p9_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TFRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Halagard?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At 7,500 inhabitants, Halagard sported a large population when compared to other Halruaan cities.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The city was located on the <a href=\"/wiki/Bay_of_Halruaa\" title=\"Bay of Halruaa\">Bay of Halruaa</a> at the mouth of the <a href=\"/wiki/Halagard_Channel\" title=\"Halagard Channel\">Halagard Channel</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TFRA-p9_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TFRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Halagard?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Halagard was governed by the <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Basel_Indoulur\" title=\"Basel Indoulur\">Basel Indoulur</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Halagard?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Up until the mid 1200's DR, Halagard was the capital city of Halruaa.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Halagard?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Halagard?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS2ed-p9-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-0\">1.00</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-1\">1.01</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-2\">1.02</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-3\">1.03</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-4\">1.04</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-5\">1.05</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-6\">1.06</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-7\">1.07</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-8\">1.08</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p9_1-9\">1.09</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tom_Prusa\" title=\"Tom Prusa\">Tom Prusa</a>&#160;(1993). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shining_South_(1993)\" title=\"The Shining South (1993)\">The Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 9. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-56076-595-X\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-56076-595-X\">1-56076-595-X</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-TFRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TFRA-p9_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TFRA-p9_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <s